---

This project is an independent reimplementation of the method described in

    Steering Instruction Hierarchies at Inference Time
    Siqi Zeng, Sewoong Lee, Han Zhao, Julia Hockenmaier
    arXiv:2607.26228, COLM 2026

written from the paper. No source code from the authors' reference
implementation (github.com/cindy2000sh/v-steer) was copied or consulted, so
this repository carries no code under their license. The citation above is an
academic attribution, not a licence condition.
